OL,3,AShip attack reports near Hormuz reach
OL,4,Arecord high as oil exports slow
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix of the vessels were struck last
OL,7,FSunday, according to the UKMTO - a
OL,8,Fone-day high. So far this week, there
OL,9,Fhave been four reported attacks.
OL,11,FAs the number of strikes has risen, the
OL,12,Frecovery in oil shipments through the
OL,13,Fstrait seen last month has slowed,
OL,14,Findustry data suggests.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
