OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZelensky rallies EU support as Trump
OL,4,Asays Ukraine leader 'more difficult to
OL,5,Adeal with than Putin'
OL,6,
OL,7,FZelensky had paused the attacks for
OL,8,Fthree days at Trump's request for a
OL,9,Fceasefire on energy targets, but said
OL,10,Fon Thursday they would resume because
OL,11,FMoscow had never stopped.
OL,13,FTensions between Washington and Kyiv
OL,14,Fhave escalated recently over the
OL,15,FUS-Russia diesel deal and restrictions
OL,16,Fon Ukraine's satellite communications
OL,17,Fon the battlefield.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
